#' Field description: dropout observation time 2
#' @field dropoutObservationTime2 Mean stage analysis time in arm 2 over exactly the replications contributing to the corresponding stage's observed dropout proportion, in the same units as accrual and survival times. NA if no replication contributes. Numeric matrices with stage rows and scenario columns for two-arm trials. In multi-arm trials, arm 1 has dimensions stage, scenario, and active arm; arm 2 is a stage-by-scenario matrix for shared control. In enrichment trials, both arms have dimensions stage, scenario, and population (subpopulations followed by the full population). A single active arm or population uses a stage-by-scenario matrix. Stage and scenario dimensions are always retained. NULL for test-statistic-based simulation. Retained in the object but omitted from print and summary output.
#' @keywords internal
